        "original_id": "298bd4d5-ee52-5d11-af07-b4f773398c6b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trinidad James, Nicholas James Williams\n- Songs: All Gold Everything\n- Music releases: Don't Be S.A.F.E.\n- Companies: Def Jam Recordings\n\nFacts:\n- Nicholas James Williams was born on September 23, 1987, and is better known by the stage name Trinidad James.\n- Trinidad James is a Trinidadian-born American rapper.\n- In 2012, Trinidad James signed a recording contract with Def Jam Recordings.\n- \"All Gold Everything\" is a song by Trinidad James.\n- \"All Gold Everything\" was released on December 20, 2012, as the first single from Trinidad James's debut mixtape \"Don't Be S.A.F.E.\" (2012).",
